{"seq":1,"slug":"building-reputation","title":"建立技术声誉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/career-and-influence/building-reputation","wordCount":1129,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"建立技术声誉\">建立技术声誉</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术声誉像复利一样积累：早期增长缓慢，越过临界点后加速增长。它的核心是把持续、可见、可信的贡献转化为长期影响力与实际机会。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复利效应</td>\n<td>持续贡献→可见度→信任→机会的正向循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声誉来源</td>\n<td>代码贡献、博客、演讲、社交媒体等，速度与持久性各异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Profile</td>\n<td>开发者的&quot;技术简历&quot;，含 Pinned Repos、README</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影响力矩阵</td>\n<td>创造、传播、连接、认可四个维度评估成长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人品牌</td>\n<td>明确技术定位与跨平台一致的形象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会转化</td>\n<td>影响力最终转化为工作、咨询、演讲、出版等机会</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声誉的复利效应\">声誉的复利效应</h2><p>技术声誉像复利一样积累——早期增长缓慢，但一旦越过临界点就会加速增长。每一次有价值的贡献、每一篇好文章、每一次演讲都在你的&quot;声誉账户&quot;中存入一笔。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CONTRIBUTE[持续贡献] --&gt; VISIBLE[可见度提升]&#10;    VISIBLE --&gt; TRUST[信任积累]&#10;    TRUST --&gt; OPPORTUNITY[机会涌现]&#10;    OPPORTUNITY --&gt; MORE[更多高质量贡献]&#10;    MORE --&gt; VISIBLE\">graph TD\n    CONTRIBUTE[持续贡献] --&gt; VISIBLE[可见度提升]\n    VISIBLE --&gt; TRUST[信任积累]\n    TRUST --&gt; OPPORTUNITY[机会涌现]\n    OPPORTUNITY --&gt; MORE[更多高质量贡献]\n    MORE --&gt; VISIBLE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声誉来源</th>\n<th>积累速度</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源代码贡献</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术博客</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术演讲</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交媒体</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stack Overflow</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术书籍</td>\n<td>极慢</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 不要试图同时在所有渠道建立声誉。选择 2-3 个与你技能匹配的渠道，深度投入。深度比广度更能建立可持续的技术影响力。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-profile-优化\">GitHub Profile 优化</h2><p>GitHub 是开发者的&quot;技术简历&quot;。一个精心维护的 GitHub Profile 可以在无需主动推销的情况下展示你的技术实力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 👋 Hi, I&#39;m [Your Name]&#10;&#10;🔧 Core contributor to [Project A](link) and [Project B](link) 📝 Writing about web performance at [blog.example.com](link) 🎤 Speaker at [ReactConf, VueConf, JSConf](links)&#10;&#10;## 🏆 Highlights&#10;&#10;- 🌟 Created [awesome-lib](link) — 5K+ stars, used by 200+ companies&#10;- 🔀 Top 10 contributor to [famous-project](link)&#10;- 📖 Author of &quot;Book Title&quot; (Publisher, 2026)&#10;&#10;## 📊 This Week&#10;&#10;- Working on: Feature X for Project A&#10;- Writing: Blog post about Y&#10;- Reading: Paper about Z\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 👋 Hi, I'm [Your Name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">🔧 Core contributor to [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Project A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) and [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Project B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) 📝 Writing about web performance at [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">blog.example.com</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) 🎤 Speaker at [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">ReactConf, VueConf, JSConf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">links</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 🏆 Highlights</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 🌟 Created [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">awesome-lib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) — 5K+ stars, used by 200+ companies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 🔀 Top 10 contributor to [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">famous-project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 📖 Author of \"Book Title\" (Publisher, 2026)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 📊 This Week</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Working on: Feature X for Project A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Writing: Blog post about Y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Reading: Paper about Z</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh api user --jq &#39;{login, public_repos, followers, following}&#39;&#10;&#10;gh api users/{username}/repos --jq &#39;sort_by(-.stargazers_count) | .[0:5] | .[] | &quot;\\(.name): \\(.stargazers_count) ⭐&quot;&#39;&#10;&#10;gh api graphql -f query=&#39;{ user(login: &quot;{username}&quot;) { contributionsCollection { totalCommitContributions totalPullRequestContributions totalIssueContributions } } }&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{login, public_repos, followers, following}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> users/{username}/repos</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sort_by(-.stargazers_count) | .[0:5] | .[] | \"\\(.name): \\(.stargazers_count) ⭐\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graphql</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query='{ user(login: \"{username}\") { contributionsCollection { totalCommitContributions totalPullRequestContributions totalIssueContributions } } }'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Profile 元素</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>优化建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头像</td>\n<td>第一印象</td>\n<td>使用真实照片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bio</td>\n<td>快速了解你</td>\n<td>突出核心技能和角色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pinned Repos</td>\n<td>展示代表作</td>\n<td>选择 Star 最多或最有代表性的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>README</td>\n<td>详细自我介绍</td>\n<td>包含贡献亮点和当前工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Contribution Graph</td>\n<td>活跃度展示</td>\n<td>保持持续的贡献记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"技术影响力矩阵\">技术影响力矩阵</h2><p>系统化地评估和提升技术影响力，需要一个多维度的框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((技术影响力矩阵))&#10;    创造&#10;      开源项目&#10;      技术工具&#10;      框架/库&#10;    传播&#10;      博客文章&#10;      技术演讲&#10;      视频教程&#10;    连接&#10;      社区参与&#10;      导师指导&#10;      协作项目&#10;    认可&#10;      Star/Fork&#10;      邀请演讲&#10;      媒体报道\">mindmap\n  root((技术影响力矩阵))\n    创造\n      开源项目\n      技术工具\n      框架/库\n    传播\n      博客文章\n      技术演讲\n      视频教程\n    连接\n      社区参与\n      导师指导\n      协作项目\n    认可\n      Star/Fork\n      邀请演讲\n      媒体报道</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>初级（0-1年）</th>\n<th>中级（1-3年）</th>\n<th>高级（3年以上）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创造</td>\n<td>发布小工具/库</td>\n<td>维护活跃的中型项目</td>\n<td>创建有生态系统的项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播</td>\n<td>每月 1 篇博文</td>\n<td>在地区会议演讲</td>\n<td>在国际大会做 Keynote</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接</td>\n<td>参与社区讨论</td>\n<td>组织本地 Meetup</td>\n<td>建立跨区域社区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认可</td>\n<td>100+ Star</td>\n<td>1000+ Star, 演讲邀请</td>\n<td>行业奖项, 媒体报道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"个人品牌建设\">个人品牌建设</h2><p>个人品牌是技术声誉的外在表现形式。一致的品牌形象让人更容易记住你。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    NICHE[确定技术定位] --&gt; CONTENT[持续内容输出]&#10;    CONTENT --&gt; IDENTITY[统一视觉标识]&#10;    IDENTITY --&gt; CROSS[跨平台一致]&#10;    CROSS --&gt; RECOGNIZE[被行业认可]\">graph LR\n    NICHE[确定技术定位] --&gt; CONTENT[持续内容输出]\n    CONTENT --&gt; IDENTITY[统一视觉标识]\n    IDENTITY --&gt; CROSS[跨平台一致]\n    CROSS --&gt; RECOGNIZE[被行业认可]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品牌要素</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术定位</td>\n<td>&quot;Web 性能优化专家&quot;</td>\n<td>所有平台的 Bio 一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户名</td>\n<td>跨平台统一用户名</td>\n<td>GitHub = Twitter = Blog</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉标识</td>\n<td>统一头像和配色</td>\n<td>所有平台使用同一头像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容调性</td>\n<td>深度技术 + 实践导向</td>\n<td>文章、演讲、社交风格一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标志性内容</td>\n<td>系列文章或年度总结</td>\n<td>形成读者期待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir -p brand-kit&#10;&#10;cat &gt; brand-kit/bio.md &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;短版 Bio（一行）：&#10;Web Performance Engineer. Open source contributor. Writing at blog.example.com.&#10;&#10;中版 Bio（三行）：&#10;Web Performance Engineer specialized in React and Next.js optimization.&#10;Core contributor to [Project]. Speaker at ReactConf and JSConf.&#10;Writing about web performance at blog.example.com.&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> brand-kit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> brand-kit/bio.md</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">短版 Bio（一行）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Web Performance Engineer. Open source contributor. Writing at blog.example.com.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">中版 Bio（三行）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Web Performance Engineer specialized in React and Next.js optimization.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Core contributor to [Project]. Speaker at ReactConf and JSConf.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Writing about web performance at blog.example.com.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 技术定位不必过于狭窄。&quot;React 性能优化&quot;比&quot;Web 开发&quot;更有辨识度，但比&quot;React useMemo 的使用&quot;更有持久性。找到既有特色又有足够广度的定位。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"将影响力转化为机会\">将影响力转化为机会</h2><p>技术影响力的最终价值在于它能带来什么实际机会。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机会类型</th>\n<th>来源渠道</th>\n<th>前提条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作邀请</td>\n<td>GitHub/博客被发现</td>\n<td>持续可见的高质量贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>咨询邀约</td>\n<td>演讲/文章建立专家形象</td>\n<td>特定领域的深度专业性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演讲邀请</td>\n<td>前一次演讲的口碑传播</td>\n<td>有良好的往期演讲记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出版机会</td>\n<td>博客积累形成书稿基础</td>\n<td>持续输出 + 出版社关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资/赞助</td>\n<td>开源项目的商业价值</td>\n<td>项目有明确的用户群和增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BRAND[个人品牌] --&gt; INBOUND[机会主动找你]&#10;    BRAND --&gt; OUTBOUND[你主动争取]&#10;    INBOUND --&gt; JOB[工作邀请]&#10;    INBOUND --&gt; CONSULT[咨询邀约]&#10;    INBOUND --&gt; SPEAK[演讲邀请]&#10;    OUTBOUND --&gt; APPLY[投稿/CFP]&#10;    OUTBOUND --&gt; PITCH[项目推介]&#10;    OUTBOUND --&gt; NETWORK[人脉拓展]\">graph TD\n    BRAND[个人品牌] --&gt; INBOUND[机会主动找你]\n    BRAND --&gt; OUTBOUND[你主动争取]\n    INBOUND --&gt; JOB[工作邀请]\n    INBOUND --&gt; CONSULT[咨询邀约]\n    INBOUND --&gt; SPEAK[演讲邀请]\n    OUTBOUND --&gt; APPLY[投稿/CFP]\n    OUTBOUND --&gt; PITCH[项目推介]\n    OUTBOUND --&gt; NETWORK[人脉拓展]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((建立技术声誉))&#10;    复利效应&#10;      持续贡献&#10;      可见度提升&#10;      信任积累&#10;    GitHub Profile&#10;      Pinned Repos&#10;      README 优化&#10;      Contribution Graph&#10;    影响力矩阵&#10;      创造&#10;      传播&#10;      连接&#10;      认可&#10;    个人品牌&#10;      技术定位&#10;      跨平台一致&#10;      标志性内容&#10;    机会转化&#10;      工作邀请&#10;      演讲邀请&#10;      咨询邀约\">mindmap\n  root((建立技术声誉))\n    复利效应\n      持续贡献\n      可见度提升\n      信任积累\n    GitHub Profile\n      Pinned Repos\n      README 优化\n      Contribution Graph\n    影响力矩阵\n      创造\n      传播\n      连接\n      认可\n    个人品牌\n      技术定位\n      跨平台一致\n      标志性内容\n    机会转化\n      工作邀请\n      演讲邀请\n      咨询邀约</pre><ul>\n<li>技术声誉像复利一样积累，早期投入的回报会在后期加速显现。</li>\n<li>GitHub Profile 是开发者的技术简历，应精心优化 Pinned Repos、README 和贡献记录。</li>\n<li>使用创造、传播、连接、认可四个维度的影响力矩阵评估和规划成长路径。</li>\n<li>个人品牌需要明确的技术定位和跨平台一致的形象。</li>\n<li>技术影响力最终应转化为实际机会：工作、咨询、演讲、出版和投资。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"建立技术声誉","id":"建立技术声誉"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"声誉的复利效应","id":"声誉的复利效应"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Profile 优化","id":"github-profile-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"技术影响力矩阵","id":"技术影响力矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"个人品牌建设","id":"个人品牌建设"},{"level":2,"text":"将影响力转化为机会","id":"将影响力转化为机会"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开发者布道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/technical-writing/developer-advocacy"},"next":{"title":"赞助与资金","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/career-and-influence/sponsorship-and-funding"}}